            <description><![CDATA[<h2>What's New in 0.13.6</h2><ul><li>Fix Boost quiet audio when extracting with FFmpeg</li><li>Bump FluidAudio to 0.18.2 and add Phonon-2</li><li>Simplify TTS settings and use real logos for local TTS providers</li><li>Apply language changes without restarting</li><li>Simplify the settings pages</li><li>Always apply the glossary to transcription</li><li>Remove the transcription results page size setting</li><li>Keep recordings running when audio capture fails</li></ul>]]></description>
